WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.550
The ring that stands still.

00:02.341 --> 00:10.468
Much higher, nearly thirty-six thousand kilometres up, a satellite takes one day to go round, so from the ground it hangs over one spot.

00:11.029 --> 00:13.799
That is why a television dish never has to move.

00:14.330 --> 00:18.339
Weather satellites sit here too, each watching one side of the Earth.
